50
00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:20.340
Saudi Arabia: seven hundred and fifty-four million dollars (one prince's yacht).

51
00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:28.100
U.K.: six hundred and eighty-six million dollars. France: five hundred and sixty-three million dollars (military cheese

52
00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:34.360
allocation). And so on... Why This Is Actually About National Security (No, Really).

53
00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:40.060
Here's what actually threatens nations today: Real Threats (That Actually Kill People).

54
00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:46.640
Pandemics: COVID killed more Americans than World War Two, Korea, and Vietnam combined.

55
00:05:47.420 --> 00:05:53.400
Cancer: Kills ten million globally per year. Heart Disease: eighteen million annual deaths.

56
00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:58.800
Dementia: Destroying the minds of every nation's elderly (and sometimes their leaders).

57
00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:07.480
Climate Disasters: Making entire regions uninhabitable. Mental Health Crisis: More people kill themselves than die in wars.

58
00:06:08.140 --> 00:06:14.160
Overfunded Threats (That Countries Spend Trillions On). Other Countries Attacking: It happens.

59
00:06:14.380 --> 00:06:21.500
It's real. Ask Ukraine. But disease kills two hundred and twenty-five more people every year, and you're funding them in

60
00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:23.520
