You keep ninety-nine percent of your weapons. If ninety-nine percent of your military can't handle the job, the last one

63
00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:41.780
percent wasn't going to save you. The Rebranding Campaign: From "Weakness" to "Strategic Genius".

