00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:32.640
Not die of cancer (even arms dealers get cancer). Lockheed Martin Presents: The F thirty-five Cancer Killer Boeing Proud

108
00:11:32.640 --> 00:11:38.600
Sponsor of: Not Dying of Alzheimer's. Raytheon Technologies: Now With one percent Less Death.

